# Fallback for builders that ignore Dockerfile.worker.dockerignore (classic builder, some CI): never send secrets or state.
# The allow-list in Dockerfile.worker.dockerignore is the real filter under BuildKit.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.trading
**/.trading
**/node_modules
.git
mcp/.env*
worker/.env*
!worker/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/api-wallet.json
